WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.568
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.568 --> 00:00:04.103
We hope you're
doing well tonight.

00:00:04.103 --> 00:00:06.105
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:09.675
President Biden and First Lady
Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:09.675 --> 00:00:12.312
were photographed yesterday
walking on the beach.

00:00:12.312 --> 00:00:14.647
And when there were
one set of footprints,

00:00:14.647 --> 00:00:18.851
that's when Jill carried him.

00:00:18.851 --> 00:00:21.788
That's right. President Biden
and First Lady Dr. Jill Biden

00:00:21.788 --> 00:00:23.489
were photographed
walking on the beach,

00:00:23.489 --> 00:00:29.496
while Kevin McCarthy was spotted
walking into the ocean.

00:00:29.496 --> 00:00:31.497
President Biden
and Israeli Prime Minister

00:00:31.497 --> 00:00:34.533
Benjamin Netanyahu reportedly
spoke last night on the phone.

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:37.704
Well, if anything can delay
an Israeli ground invasion,

00:00:37.704 --> 00:00:40.440
it's one of Biden's stories.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.909
"Let me tell you
about my track and field days.

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:49.049
They called me -- they called me
the Scranton Flier."

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.016
Following reports that
he repeatedly

00:00:51.016 --> 00:00:54.320
shared sensitive information
with Australian billionaire

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.055
Anthony Pratt,
former President Trump

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:57.957
released a statement
in<i> The New York Times</i> yesterday

00:00:57.957 --> 00:01:01.060
and said Pratt is from
a friendly country in Australia,

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:02.295
one of our great allies,

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:04.063
and added, quote,
"I don't know him well,

00:01:04.063 --> 00:01:05.765
but he seemed like
a nice person."

00:01:05.765 --> 00:01:09.735
He seemed like a nice person?

00:01:09.735 --> 00:01:11.171
You know, I don't think
it's safe for America

00:01:11.171 --> 00:01:13.005
to have a president
who could be kidnapped

00:01:13.005 --> 00:01:17.177
with just a puppy
and a van.

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:19.112
[As Trump] In my defense...

00:01:19.112 --> 00:01:21.147
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.147 --> 00:01:25.652
What -- What bad people have
a puppy?

00:01:25.652 --> 00:01:29.055
Next thing I know, I'm in a van.

00:01:29.055 --> 00:01:30.990
Treated very badly.

00:01:33.359 --> 00:01:35.227
[Normally] Senate Minority
Leader Mitch McConnell

00:01:35.227 --> 00:01:37.730
appeared yesterday
on "Face the Nation."

00:01:37.730 --> 00:01:40.133
This was video, by the way.

00:01:40.133 --> 00:01:43.169
[ Laughter ]

00:01:43.169 --> 00:01:44.804
That's a clip.

00:01:47.507 --> 00:01:50.242
Today marks the House's
third week without a Speaker.

00:01:50.242 --> 00:01:52.945
On the plus side, they've
accomplished almost as much as

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:56.483
when they had a Speaker
for three months.

00:01:56.483 --> 00:01:58.217
Nine House Republicans
have announced

00:01:58.217 --> 00:01:59.552
plans to run for Speaker,

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:01.487
but if you wanted
to see nine people

00:02:01.487 --> 00:02:03.156
who have no chance of winning,

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:06.992
just go to a Mets game.

00:02:06.992 --> 00:02:10.028
Got it in just
under the wire.

00:02:10.028 --> 00:02:14.133
It's still technically baseball
season, so that's not --

00:02:14.133 --> 00:02:15.701
And you might be saying,
"The Mets have more

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:18.938
than nine people on their team."
Do they?

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:24.643
After leaving a three-hour-long
closed door meeting last

00:02:24.643 --> 00:02:27.013
Thursday with House Republicans,
Wisconsin Congressman

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:28.581
Mike Gallagher told reporters,
quote,

00:02:28.581 --> 00:02:30.550
"Temperatures are
really high in there."

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:33.987
Well, that's what happens when
only half of them are vaxed.

00:02:37.156 --> 00:02:40.726
That -- I do want to stress,
that's exactly --

00:02:40.726 --> 00:02:44.897
that's exactly how
I thought that would go.

00:02:44.897 --> 00:02:48.667
Don't think you caught me
off guard.

00:02:48.667 --> 00:02:51.036
The remaining games
of a youth football season

00:02:51.036 --> 00:02:52.605
in Tennessee
were canceled recently

00:02:52.605 --> 00:02:55.175
after parents of opposing teams
got into a fight

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:57.976
and one man allegedly
brandished a gun.

00:02:57.976 --> 00:02:58.978
While in Texas,

00:02:58.978 --> 00:03:01.314
that's just
a five-yard penalty.

00:03:03.549 --> 00:03:06.920
Today was national
TV Talk Show Host Day.

00:03:06.920 --> 00:03:08.620
My writers passed around a card,

00:03:08.620 --> 00:03:10.290
but it was for Kimmel.

00:03:13.659 --> 00:03:15.727
Long Island railroad workers
in New York

00:03:15.727 --> 00:03:17.430
recently returned
a lost backpack

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:21.167
with $12,000 to its owner
after she left it onto a train.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:24.270
Even more surprising,
the woman had $12,000

00:03:24.270 --> 00:03:27.173
and still took
the Long Island Railroad.

00:03:29.742 --> 00:03:32.745
And finally, Amazon announced
plans last week to begin testing

00:03:32.745 --> 00:03:36.081
a humanoid robot called Digit,
which has arms and legs

00:03:36.081 --> 00:03:38.751
and can move, grasp,
and handle items like a person,

00:03:38.751 --> 00:03:41.921
and most important of all,
no bladder.

00:03:47.860 --> 00:03:53.666
And we've maybe miscalculated
what our closer was.

00:03:53.666 --> 00:03:56.903
But we can't go back in time.

00:03:56.903 --> 00:04:00.873
So I will simply say
that was a monologue, everybody.

